{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this day, you suddenly took over a hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What! And there are cat employees too?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then why not just open a hotel that can accommodate cats? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the staff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the furniture for the cats! And don't forget to prepare food for them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operating a hotel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrange rooms according to the guests' requests! When the guests check out, they will leave a rating. Try your best to improve the rating! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorating the room</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fill the room with various furniture and use four different room layouts to meet the needs of different guests! Work hard to expand the house and earn more money!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861330?t=1754119287","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861330?t=1754119287","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861330/f9ff646fd1b3df1921189a3141e137743517f5e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754119287","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861330/f9ff646fd1b3df1921189a3141e137743517f5e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754119287","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this day, you suddenly took over a hotel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What! And there are cat employees too?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then why not just open a hotel that can accommodate cats? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the staff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the furniture for the cats! And don't forget to prepare food for them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Op